          "text": "Premenstrual mood symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "For years, 7–10 days before menses: marked irritability, mood swings, increased anxiety, and feeling unable to cope. Symptoms resolve 2–3 days after bleeding starts."
      }
    },
    {
